WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.151
It was nighttime.

2
00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:23.414
The fairies were outside Joey's house.

3
00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:31.731
"How do we get in?" Bumble whispered.

4
00:00:31.732 --> 00:00:35.162
"I see an open window," Sprite said.

5
00:00:35.163 --> 00:00:39.805
"Come on!"

6
00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:46.340
The fairies flew up to Joey’s room.

7
00:00:46.341 --> 00:00:52.873
As they slipped inside, Bumble gasped.

8
00:00:52.874 --> 00:00:55.846
"There are two beds.

9
00:00:55.847 --> 00:01:00.930
This is Bruce’s room too!"

10
00:01:00.931 --> 00:01:04.357
Just then Bruce rolled over.

11
00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:07.878
He was talking in his sleep.

12
00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:13.059
"Shh," Hob hissed. "Don't wake him!

13
00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:18.434
Let's grab something and go!"

14
00:01:18.435 --> 00:01:24.685
Feather spotted a shiny rock next to Joey's bed.

15
00:01:24.686 --> 00:01:32.613
"That rock is pretty," she said. "Let's get it!"

16
00:01:32.614 --> 00:01:38.185
"No!" Hob said. "That's too close to him.

17
00:01:38.186 --> 00:01:42.687
Let's take something easy, like this."

18
00:01:42.688 --> 00:01:46.514
He pointed to a book on the floor.

19
00:01:46.515 --> 00:01:53.082
Bumble frowned as he looked around.

20
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:57.064
"How do we know what belongs to Joey?

21
00:01:57.065 --> 00:02:01.316
Some of this stuff must belong to Bruce."

22
00:02:01.317 --> 00:02:07.582
"Good point, Bumble," Sprite said.

23
00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:14.185
Sprite flew around the room. Then

24
00:02:14.186 --> 00:02:18.788
she pointed to a cabinet. "There!" The

25
00:02:18.789 --> 00:02:22.430
name Joey was written on the door. "He

26
00:02:22.431 --> 00:02:28.215
probably keeps his special things in there." Feather

27
00:02:28.216 --> 00:02:31.900
helped Sprite open the door. One

28
00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:39.328
shelf was filled with rows of tall toy soldiers. "We

29
00:02:39.329 --> 00:02:42.910
can't take a soldier," Hob said. "They're

30
00:02:42.911 --> 00:02:46.244
as big as we are!" Sprite

31
00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:49.718
grinned and pulled a pouch from her pocket. "Time

32
00:02:49.719 --> 00:02:55.219
for some shrinking powder!" Sprite

33
00:02:55.220 --> 00:03:01.199
sprinkled powder on one soldier. It

34
00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.796
shrank to the size of a button. "Perfect!"

35
00:03:04.797 --> 00:03:09.072
Bumble reached for the tiny soldier. Then—

36
00:03:09.073 --> 00:03:13.710
clunk! He knocked into a big one.

37
00:03:13.711 --> 00:03:20.435
The big soldier crashed to the floor. Thud!

38
00:03:20.436 --> 00:03:25.681
The fairies froze as Bruce sat up in bed.

39
00:03:25.682 --> 00:03:29.218
He blinked in surprise. "Whoa!

40
00:03:29.219 --> 00:03:32.391
Those tiny people are back!"

41
00:03:32.392 --> 00:03:35.182
Bruce jumped out of bed.

42
00:03:35.183 --> 00:03:39.914
"I'm going to catch you!" he growled.

43
00:03:39.915 --> 00:03:46.554
He grabbed his pillowcase—and ran at the fairies!

